[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5940.87, "timestamp": "01:39:00", "text": "好的。它是一种远程攻击，但它允许"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5943.51, "timestamp": "01:39:03", "text": "你吸引人们向你靠近，然后移动"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5958.47, "timestamp": "01:39:18", "text": "还有，呃，我有哪些种类的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5960.07, "timestamp": "01:39:20", "text": "现在？就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5962.629, "timestamp": "01:39:22", "text": "哦，现在你有光，你有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5965.43, "timestamp": "01:39:25", "text": "呃，产生火焰，而且你还有呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5991.109, "timestamp": "01:39:51", "text": "所以这意味着我有一个实用工具"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5995.83, "timestamp": "01:39:55", "text": "冒犯就像损坏这东西一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5999.03, "timestamp": "01:39:59", "text": "呃，不。你和一个人支持，对吧？"}]